WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:03.175
Every day, millions of people follow the same routes.

00:00:03.175 --> 00:00:03.969
The same roads.

00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:04.923
The same routines.

00:00:04.923 --> 00:00:08.367
But what happens when something unexpected happens along the way?

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:09.788
An accident.

00:00:09.788 --> 00:00:10.730
A road closure.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:11.673
Heavy rainfall.

00:00:11.673 --> 00:00:12.930
A sudden disruption.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:19.467
By the time conventional navigation detects the problem, commuters may already be trapped in congestion.

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:21.296
Introducing City Pulse.

00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:28.600
An intelligent, multi-agent system designed to detect, validate, and anticipate traffic disruptions, before they affect your journey.

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:38.193
Working around the clock, the platform continuously gathers information from public sources, social media, traffic services, weather data, and community reports.

00:00:38.193 --> 00:00:43.800
Every post, image, video, and report could contain an early signal of a developing traffic incident.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:48.861
Instead of relying on a single source, specialised AI agents work together.

00:00:48.861 --> 00:00:50.419
One analyses social feeds.

00:00:50.419 --> 00:00:52.697
Another understands images and videos.

00:00:52.697 --> 00:00:56.412
Others identify patterns, sentiment, and relevant information.

00:00:56.412 --> 00:01:00.967
Together, they transform scattered information into actionable intelligence.

00:01:01.533 --> 00:01:03.388
But not every report is reliable.

00:01:03.388 --> 00:01:10.974
The system cross-checks information, verifies the location, evaluates supporting evidence, and filters out false or irrelevant reports.

00:01:10.974 --> 00:01:14.233
Only credible incidents move forward for further analysis.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:22.038
Once an incident is verified, the predictive agent analyses traffic, weather, and surrounding conditions to estimate its potential impact.

00:01:22.038 --> 00:01:25.500
It identifies which routes may be affected, and who needs to know.

00:01:26.067 --> 00:01:29.831
Before you reach the disruption, you receive a personalised notification.

00:01:29.831 --> 00:01:37.000
Your affected route is highlighted, and an alternative is recommended, helping you make a better decision before traffic builds around you.

00:01:37.733 --> 00:01:40.508
And the intelligence doesn't stop with the commuter.

00:01:40.508 --> 00:01:49.100
Verified incident information is also shared with the nearest relevant traffic control station, helping authorities respond earlier, and make informed decisions.

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:52.720
From scattered information, to verified intelligence.

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:55.831
From reactive traffic updates, to proactive awareness.

00:01:55.831 --> 00:02:00.267
One connected intelligence system, helping commuters and cities move smarter.

00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:01.603
City Pulse.

00:02:01.603 --> 00:02:02.933
Know before you go.

